[size=22][b]👋 [u]Welcome to Looksmax![/u][/b][/size]

 [size=15]This is a community for men who wish to [b]improve their looks[/b] and become more [b]successful in life[/b]. If you are interested in:[/size]

[list]
[*]Looking better
[*]Attracting the opposite sex
[*]Becoming wealthy
[*]Gaining status
[*]Being rated
[*]Becoming the best version of yourself
[/list]

 [size=15]...then this is the forum for you.[/size]

[hr]

 [size=22][b]👥 [u]Userbase[/u][/b][/size]

 [size=15]We are a [b]male-only community[/b], as most discussions revolve around [b]masculine-specific topics[/b]. There are many equivalent female-only looksmaxing sites out there — please respect that this one is male-only.[/size]

[hr]

 [size=22][b]📜 [u]Rules[/u][/b][/size]

 [size=18][b]📂 [u]Content and Behavior[/u][/b][/size]

 [size=15][b]Do not:[/b][/size]

[list]
[*][b]Post private content[/b]
[list]
[*]This includes private messages, user info, or images.
[*]Posting private surgery results is strictly prohibited and will result in a [b]permanent ban[/b].
[/list]
[*][b]Dox or threaten to dox[/b]
[list]
[*]This applies to anyone, even those outside the community.
[/list]
[*][b]Mass-tag users[/b]
[*][b]Spam[/b]
[list]
[*]Includes AI-generated content or repetitive posting.
[/list]
[*][b]Use bots, scripts, or automation[/b] to post or manipulate reputation.
[*][b]Impersonate users[/b]
[list]
[*]Includes using someone else’s current or old username.
[/list]
[*][b]Spread misinformation[/b]
[*][b]Advertise[/b] without staff permission.
[*][b]Post LGBTQ+ content[/b]
[*][b]Post low-effort content[/b]
[list]
[*]Only allowed in the Offtopic section.
[*]Not allowed in threads tagged as “Serious.”
[/list]
[*][b]Necropost[/b]
[list]
[*]Avoid replying to threads older than 1 month unless you have a good reason.
[*]“Bumps,” one-liners, quoting, or simple agreement are not valid reasons.
[/list]
[*][b]Post illegal content[/b] or [b]incite illegal activity.[/b]
[list]
[*]If you're unsure whether something is allowed, [i]don’t post it[/i].
[/list]
[*][b]Sexualize minors[/b]
[list]
[*]Any individual under the age of 18.
[/list]
[*][b]Create more than one account[/b] or [b]share your account[/b]
[list]
[*]All accounts will be banned.
[/list]
[*][b]Post on behalf of banned users[/b]
[*][b]Post gore and shock material[/b]
[*][b]Repfarm[/b]
[*][b]NSFW (nudity) profile pictures and banners[/b]
[*][b]Pretending or mentioning to be a female to cause confusion on the forum and staff[/b]
[list]
[*]Do not manipulate the reputation system for gain.
[/list]
[*][b]Exist solely to troll or intentionally disrupt the forum[/b]
[list]
[*]While exaggerated personas may be tolerated, accounts whose primary or only intent is to antagonize others, incite conflict, or undermine the forum’s integrity will face permanent removal.
[/list]
[/list]

